  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "Concept:\n\nWe would use the concept of BODMAS-\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/5e88f2c958b15f566f943ec5d9b049b059d3f8ea52aa2135423fd7e1435460ed.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n 60 ÷ 16 × 2 - [76 ÷ 5 of 19 - 15 ÷ 8 × (21 - 25) - 3] ÷ 53\n\n⇒ 60 ÷ 16 × 2 - [76 ÷ 5 of 19 - 15 ÷ 8 × -4 - 3] ÷ 53\n\n⇒ 60 ÷ 16 × 2 - [76 ÷ 95 - 15 ÷ 8 × -4 - 3] ÷ 53\n\n⇒ 60 ÷ 16 × 2 - [4over5 - 15over8 × -4 - 3] ÷ 53\n\n⇒ 60 ÷ 16 × 2 - [4over5 + 15over2 - 3] ÷ 53\n\n⇒ 60 ÷ 16 × 2 - [83over10 - 3] ÷ 53\n\n⇒ 60 ÷ 16 × 2 - [83-30over10] ÷ 53\n\n⇒ 60 ÷ 16 × 2 - [53over10] ÷ 53\n\n⇒ 15over4 × 2 - 1over10\n\n⇒ 15over2 - 1over10\n\n⇒ 74over10 = 7(2)/({5)}\n\n∴ The answer is** 7(2)/({5)}.**",
